Act as a Principal SDET / Automation Architect reviewing an enterprise Playwright automation framework.

Your goal is NOT to rewrite the framework.
Your goal is to perform a complete architecture review exactly as you would during a production code review.

Before suggesting improvements:

1. Reverse engineer the framework architecture.
2. Understand the complete execution flow.
3. Trace the lifecycle of a test from:
   Test Spec
   → Fixtures
   → App Fixture
   → Test Helper
   → Page Objects
   → Utilities
   → Assertions
   → Reporting
4. Understand data flow.
5. Understand dependency flow.
6. Identify ownership of responsibilities.

Only after understanding the framework, perform a review.

