Important Rules

- Do NOT change functionality.
- Do NOT rewrite the framework unnecessarily.
- Do NOT suggest changes without explaining why.
- Prefer incremental improvements over complete rewrites.
- Consider this is an enterprise banking automation framework with many existing tests.
- Recommend only production-grade improvements that are suitable for a real enterprise codebase.

Finally provide:

1. Architecture diagram (text format)

2. Framework strengths

3. Top 10 technical debts

4. Top 10 quick wins

5. Top 10 long-term improvements

6. Overall architecture score (/10)

7. Maintainability score (/10)

